{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a 5-question FAQ section identical to the reference.
    
    ⚠️ Do not change any text, wording, punctuation, or design elements.
    ⚠️ Only ensure the layout is responsive and looks great on all devices.
    
    CONTENT (must remain exactly the same)
    
    Title (uppercase):
    ❓ COMMON QUESTIONS
    
    QUESTIONS & ANSWERS
    
    Question 1:
    Why take both bottles together?
    Answer:
    They work better as a team. One recharges your cells (NAD+). The other activates your longevity genes (NMN). Together, they give you more energy AND help you age better. Think of it like eating protein + vegetables instead of just one.
    
    Question 2:
    When will I feel something?
    Answer:
    Everyone’s different, but most notice a change by week 3. Week 1–2 is foundation building. Week 6–8 brings noticeable recovery benefits. Full benefits at 3 months.
    
    Question 3:
    Is it safe?
    Answer:
    Yes. Made in USA facilities, every batch is tested, and backed by 200+ studies. If you're on medication, check with your doctor first.
    
    Question 4:
    Can I see your lab reports?
    Answer:
    Yes. We publish Certificate of Analysis (COA) for every batch. [Link to Reports]
    
    Question 5:
    What if it doesn’t work?
    Answer:
    Use both bottles for 90 days. Not happy? Send us the empty bottles and we’ll refund you 100%. No questions asked.
    
    DESIGN & STYLE RULES
    
    Clean, minimal, premium supplement-brand design
    
    Clear vertical spacing between questions
    
    Question text bold and slightly larger than the answer text
    
    Bullet points aligned with check and cross icons
    
    Section with ample white space for readability
    
    RESPONSIVENESS (MANDATORY)
    
    Desktop:
    
    Questions listed vertically
    
    Tablet:
    
    Same layout, with slight adjustments to text alignment
    
    Mobile:
    
    Full-width questions, stacked vertically
    
    Ensure no horizontal scrolling on mobile screens
    
    TECHNICAL CONSTRAINTS
    
    Use semantic HTML
    
    Use Flexbox or CSS Grid for layout
    
    Use media queries for mobile responsiveness
    
    Mobile-first design
    
    Fully compatible with Shopify Dawn theme
    
    No JavaScript
    
    The final result must look exactly like the reference, with text properly aligned and readable.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-faq-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-faq-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 50px 0;
  }

  .ai-faq-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.question_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.item_padding }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.item_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
  }

  .ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.question_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.question_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.answer_size }}px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: {{ block.settings.answer_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.link_color }};
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.link_hover_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }

    .ai-faq-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size | times: 0.75 }}px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.question_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.answer_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.item_padding | times: 0.75 }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 50px 24px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-faq-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <h2 class="ai-faq-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.title }}</h2>
    
    <div class="ai-faq-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h3 class="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.question_1 }}</h3>
        <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.answer_1 }}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h3 class="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.question_2 }}</h3>
        <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.answer_2 }}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h3 class="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.question_3 }}</h3>
        <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.answer_3 }}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h3 class="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.question_4 }}</h3>
        <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.answer_4 }} <a href="{{ block.settings.lab_reports_link }}" target="_blank">{{ block.settings.lab_reports_text }}</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h3 class="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.question_5 }}</h3>
        <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.answer_5 }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

